    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game  Pillars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labyrinth exploration:\u00a0</strong>Explore and solve endless, procedurally generated labyrinths in a fast-paced first-person action shooter game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online leaderboards:</strong> The game features an asynchronous multiplayer system with online leaderboards that allow players to compete against each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multimedia:</strong> Experience the game with both a PC desktop and VR through your favourite headset, feel the emotions inside the labyrinths in VR!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI:</strong> Play against AI, your main opponent. It is an alien AI that rules the world of LABYRAINTH. It creates always different labyrinths and populates them with aliens, traps and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/755ae128df73095058c778bd4d84e547.poster.avif?t=1755611735\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/755ae128df73095058c778bd4d84e547.webm?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/755ae128df73095058c778bd4d84e547.mp4?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LABYRAINTH will test your <strong>reflexes</strong>, your <strong>memory</strong>, and your <strong>skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objectives are</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. <strong>Escape</strong> from the labyrinths as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. <strong>Fight to survive</strong> by shooting <strong>aliens</strong> and avoiding <strong>traps</strong> that try to defeat you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. <strong>Upgrade</strong> your <strong>weapon</strong> and <strong>improve</strong> your <strong>abilities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. <strong>Compete</strong> with other players in online <strong>leaderboards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only lose in two ways:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. When the <strong>time</strong> in the labyrinth <strong>runs out</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. When aliens and traps <strong>kill you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/c645faefad0b152a6493f0d4d9fe233f.poster.avif?t=1755611735\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/c645faefad0b152a6493f0d4d9fe233f.webm?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/c645faefad0b152a6493f0d4d9fe233f.mp4?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story mode</strong>: <strong>you are the protagonist</strong> of the game. Reach the last level and escape from the world of LABYRAINTH. This is a <strong>single-player offline mode</strong>, so there are no leaderboards, but here you will discover the <strong>secret</strong> of LABYRAINTH.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Mode</strong>: <strong>infinite gameplay</strong> with an <strong>infinite number of labyrinths</strong>. Infinite progression and a continuous challenge, for <strong>hardcore</strong> gamers. Play against other players to compete in <strong>online leaderboards</strong>. Can you reach the highest level ever achieved?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked Mode</strong>: This is a weekly online mode with finite levels. Every week, <strong>new levels, the same for everyone</strong>, will be built. Players of the same rank will compete against each other on equal terms to reach the top of the weekly leaderboard. At the end of each week, the <strong>best players</strong> will receive a <strong>prize</strong> based on their final position in the <strong>leaderboard!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/4eb42462551bc978fe0eb8aa37968a91.poster.avif?t=1755611735\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/4eb42462551bc978fe0eb8aa37968a91.webm?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/4eb42462551bc978fe0eb8aa37968a91.mp4?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level represents an ever-increasing threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your <strong>weapon</strong> and your <strong>abilities</strong> to progress through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the rarest <strong>weapon components</strong> to increase your chances of survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the <strong>time</strong> it took you to get out of the labyrinth, you will receive <strong>coins</strong> as a <strong>reward</strong>. Coins can also be earned by killing enemies, destroying traps, and participating in online leaderboards. These coins can be used to purchase upgrades for your character, new ammunition, and new components for your weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/a9a00e6566e7266038c601ccb8ad7740.poster.avif?t=1755611735\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/a9a00e6566e7266038c601ccb8ad7740.webm?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/a9a00e6566e7266038c601ccb8ad7740.mp4?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LABYRAINTHVR the VR game (COMING SOON)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your favorite VR headset in <strong>LABYRAINTHVR</strong>, the VR version of the game, and physically enter the labyrinths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In LabyrAInthVR the user interaction is adapted for an immersive and true VR experience, for example you will need to physically detach and attach components to your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have designed all VR features to support any VR controller input, but we have fully tested and therefore only officially support the following headsets: <strong>Oculus Rift, Oculus Quest 2 and 3, and HP Reverb G2</strong>. Please don't hesitate to contact us if you encounter any issues with your VR headset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important note</strong>: the <strong>Game Saves</strong> and therefore your progress in the game are <strong>separate between the PC and VR versions</strong> for Infinite and Ranked modes! (The Story mode has shared game saves for PC and VR, being offline). Of course, there will be <strong>separate leaderboards</strong> for the PC and VR versions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/6c4d3457abb98476a2b6a85468ea6e55.poster.avif?t=1755611735\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/6c4d3457abb98476a2b6a85468ea6e55.webm?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/6c4d3457abb98476a2b6a85468ea6e55.mp4?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game level has countless similar labyrinths associated with it, all with the same difficulty but all different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game levels are <strong>always different</strong>; you will never find two equal levels or two equal labyrinths, even if they have the same difficulty: they are always different. There are infinite labyrinths for infinite levels. This means that LABYRAINTH has infinite <strong>replayability</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/c72a7f410c514113942dc13ce32070c1.poster.avif?t=1755611735\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/c72a7f410c514113942dc13ce32070c1.webm?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672600/extras/c72a7f410c514113942dc13ce32070c1.mp4?t=1755611735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The LABYRAINTH team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are a small indie group of passionate Italian game developers</strong>. We developed this game out of passion, in our spare time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our first title on Steam. Please be kind to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We really enjoyed creating and playing this game, and we sincerely hope you enjoy it too.</strong></p>",
